    "about": "Doors on houses that swing open when the player comes close. 'houses' says, for each house sheet, where the door sheet's 48 x 48 picture sits: pixels from the house picture's top-left corner. The house sheet itself has an open doorway. 'opening' plays as the door opens; 'closing' plays as it shuts (a little bump at the end).",
